@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Rollerblading";
}

<div class="text-center my-5">
    <h1 class="display-5">Rollerblading</h1>
    <p class="lead mx-auto" style="max-width: 700px;">
        Cardio that doesn't feel like cardio. Rollerblading burns about as much energy as a
        steady run or bike ride, but it's far gentler on your joints and a lot more fun
        than staring at screen on a treadmill.
    </p>
</div>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3 text-center">Why skate?</h2>
<div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h5 card-title">Easy on the joints</h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    Skating is a smooth glide instead of a repeated foot strike, so your knees,
                    hips and ankles avoid the pounding they take when you run.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h5 card-title">A real workout</h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    At a relaxed pace it burns about as many calories as a steady bike ride
                    or an easy jog. Pick up the speed and it keeps up with a faster run.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h5 card-title">Works muscles others miss</h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    The sideways push hits your glutes and outer hips, which running and
                    cycling mostly skip. Staying upright keeps your core working the whole time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h3 class="h5 card-title">You'll keep doing it</h3>
                <p class="card-text">
                    You cover real distance, see the neighborhood, and it feels like play.
                    The best cardio is the kind you actually show up for.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<h2 class="h4 mb-3 text-center">How it stacks up</h2>
<div class="card shadow-sm mb-5">
    <div class="card-body">
        <ul class="mb-0">
            <li class="mb-2">
                <strong>vs. Running</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Similar calorie burn at a comparable effort, with much less impact.</li>
                    <li>Running wins on simplicity: all you need is shoes and a sidewalk.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="mb-2">
                <strong>vs. Cycling</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Both are low impact, but skating is weight-bearing and trains balance.</li>
                    <li>Skates also cost less than a bike and fit in a backpack.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>vs. Swimming</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Swimming is the gentlest option and works the upper body more.</li>
                    <li>Skating needs no pool or membership, just a smooth path.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="text-center mb-5">
    <a asp-action="Compare" class="btn btn-dark">Compare the numbers</a>
</div>
